Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:56.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:59.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good god! Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.70,0:02:01.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe after\Nall the suffering
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.29,0:02:02.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we've endured to find sky island
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that it turns out to\Nbe the City of Gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.50,0:02:07.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which must be your\Nway to reward me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.17,0:02:09.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for my good behavior,\Nright, God?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.25,0:02:11.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just great!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.46,0:02:12.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.34,0:02:13.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes ago you were scared
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.55,0:02:15.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this God was gonna\Nkill you, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.89,0:02:17.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, call me shallow,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.39,0:02:18.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I don't care\Nhow scared I get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:21.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as long somebody has\Ngold waiting for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.90,0:02:23.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So do you fear or\Npraise this God?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.02,0:02:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.48,0:02:28.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm done keepin'\Nup with your mood swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:34.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FUZA squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:36.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN WARRIORS yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.49,0:02:38.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FUZA squawks]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN WARRIORS yell]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.55,0:02:49.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA chuckles]\NUseless!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.62,0:03:00.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:02.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My money says that this is
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.47,0:03:04.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,where we're supposed to\Nfind the next ordeal.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.52,0:03:07.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means another priest,\Nso you two, stay awake.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.31,0:03:08.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.77,0:03:11.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think one ordeal is enough\Nof a nightmare for today.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.86,0:03:13.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which one seems like\Nit could be out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:15.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,String? Iron? Swamp?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.28,0:03:16.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.49,0:03:18.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NRelax. It's just a grassy field.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.57,0:03:20.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOpen your eyes!\NIt's not just a field!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.49,0:03:22.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a field with a\Nthousand impaled skulls
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.50,0:03:25.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,set out like trophies to\Nscare us and it's working!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.32,0:03:26.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.44,0:03:27.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:30.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN WARRIORS yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.67,0:03:31.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:34.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:38.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:44.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:47.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:51.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:53.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Balloon!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.48,0:04:01.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.09,0:04:01.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Paramythia.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.79,0:04:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper. We fighting?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.91,0:04:06.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not now. Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:07.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NYou.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.72,0:04:09.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're ready! Come on down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll cream you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.43,0:04:14.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make your move, big guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.81,0:04:18.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NYou sound and stink\Nlike Blue Sea People.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.61,0:04:19.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means you're the ones
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,causing all the\Nchaos in Skypiea.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.82,0:04:24.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.27,0:04:26.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(2151,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}That's the guerilla we saw\Nback on the White Sea. Look.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.95,0:04:29.41,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(20,770,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}What got into him?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.49,0:04:32.54,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a guy runnin'\Naround out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:34.20,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! What do you want?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.29,0:04:35.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(773,0,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}[WYPER]\NTo destroy you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.16,0:04:40.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sobbing]\NJust blow us\Nup and get it over with!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.72,0:04:42.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to die,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.14,0:04:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then go back to your\NBlue Sea immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.93,0:04:47.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because I promise if\Nyou do anything stupid
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.19,0:04:48.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on this island...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.64,0:04:52.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...we'll execute you with Eneru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NThey're up here\Ntrying to kill this guy Eneru?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.32,0:05:00.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then that means that these\Nguerillas are different.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.15,0:05:01.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If different means\Nthey're not priests
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.93,0:05:03.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then that means they\Ndon't have to kill us!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.41,0:05:05.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So for the sake of keeping all\Nof our body parts attached,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,can we please sail on?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.62,0:05:08.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you say to a fair\Nfight, just you and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:14.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you! Please stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou stay on that tree branch!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(682.5,1053)}– [USOPP crying]\N– I'm comin' to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(680.5,1053)}– [USOPP crying]\N– Usopp get off me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.55,0:05:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hands off! I'm trying\Nto fight here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.05,0:05:25.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uphold our honor!\NI have to! We're pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:27.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll probably end up\Nkilling each other
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.35,0:05:33.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before you even have a chance\Nto make it off this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.26,0:05:40.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder why they're up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.26,0:05:41.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.51,0:05:43.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Must be pretty serious.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.64,0:05:46.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they seem to be enemies\Nof Eneru as well as us.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.81,0:05:50.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know... I really\Ndo hate this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NLet's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:05:59.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOLY THE DOG growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN E yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN F screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI]\NI'll cover you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.63,0:06:11.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI]\NGet him outta\Nthat thing's mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:13.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HOLY THE DOG groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.42,0:06:14.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move in now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:16.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH yell]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.06,0:06:26.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN WARRIORS groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:27.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:35.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN N groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.90,0:06:58.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWe've been\Nsailing forever, Sanji.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.15,0:07:00.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When can we stop?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.36,0:07:02.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NCan we stop now?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.36,0:07:03.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NSoon. I just want to make sure
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.06,0:07:04.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThe sun's going down.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.29,0:07:07.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder what we'll\Nrun into after dark.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you think we can make it\Nto the altar before then?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.21,0:07:12.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. I don't.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.13,0:07:15.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can barely see the sunset\Nthrough those clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.76,0:07:18.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised they even\Nhave sunsets up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:27.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN WARRIORS yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.63,0:07:33.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wyper! We can handle these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.63,0:07:36.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.34,0:07:37.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, help the others!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.60,0:07:38.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NGot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NChopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.87,0:07:56.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Chopper?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.51,0:07:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you can hear me, answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:01.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.52,0:08:04.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NLook, her mast is gone\Nand a wing is ripped in half.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.56,0:08:06.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's he done to\Nher since we left?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.23,0:08:08.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NObviously the\NGoing Merry was attacked!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.40,0:08:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper couldn't have\Ndone that to her!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.33,0:08:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we took so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:15.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can come out now,\Nyou'll be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.37,0:08:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At least give us a sign\Nthat you're not dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I guess that means\Nthat he's dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.21,0:08:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would it kill you\Nto think positive?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.90,0:08:28.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.24,0:08:30.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cause Nami's scared!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.87,0:08:32.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm tired!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.66,0:08:35.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:37.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:38.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NUh...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.42,0:08:43.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything stayed ship\Nshape while you were gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI sighs]\NYou don't have\Nto lie to us Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:49.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be strong! Tell us\Neverything that happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.19,0:08:54.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\N...Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:07.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP groans]\NWe're soaking wet!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.62,0:09:09.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]\NCheck it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We found it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.50,0:09:14.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's the altar with the Going\NMerry sitting right on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:15.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.04,0:09:16.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:19.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.76,0:09:22.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.97,0:09:25.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I beat the ordeal\Nof love to get here!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI thought it\Nwas spheres, not love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:28.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIf that was love,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't ever want\Nto find it again.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.60,0:09:31.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, who cares!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:33.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(594.5,1053)}– [LUFFY, SANJI cheering]\N– We're alive! We're alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.77,0:09:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're\Nhappy to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.73,0:09:38.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NSafe and sound.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.09,0:09:47.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's the... mast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.76,0:09:50.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, look. I tried,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.51,0:09:52.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it didn't matter\Nhow hard I fought.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.30,0:09:54.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He still kept\Nburning everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.68,0:09:56.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise I did\Neverything I could.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.68,0:09:59.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well are you\Ngonna be okay or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:02.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NMm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must've been scared\Nfacing that guy by yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing he\Nset the mast on fire
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.59,0:10:10.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,instead of you, right? [laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.97,0:10:14.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can figure out the details\Non the ship later. [chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.65,0:10:16.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI promise to become\Na more dependable man
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.41,0:10:19.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,starting right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.91,0:10:22.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper, stop yelling at the\Naltar and tell me something.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.66,0:10:25.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd you get rid\Nof that priest?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.21,0:10:27.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I used the whistle\Nthe Sky Knight gave us
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.13,0:10:28.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and he showed up to rescue me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.88,0:10:30.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh. Where is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.17,0:10:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't see him.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.23,0:10:45.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's willing to sacrifice\Nthis much for us
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.17,0:10:47.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even though he gave us\Nthat whistle for free.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.61,0:10:49.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for the Sky Knight,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.95,0:10:51.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you guys probably\Nwouldn't have a ship
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.57,0:10:53.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I'd for sure be dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.32,0:10:55.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got a bunch of\Nquestions for him,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I guess I'll wait\Ntill he wakes up.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.04,0:11:00.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We owe you a thanks as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:05.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.55,0:11:10.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Going Merry's trashed\Nand it'll be dark soon,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.14,0:11:11.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so there's no chance\Nwe'll make it
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.35,0:11:13.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,back to Angel Island\Nuntil tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NWe should hop over to the land
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.10,0:11:17.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and make camp on\Nshore for the night.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.02,0:11:19.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHm? Why there?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.52,0:11:21.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because if we stay here\Nand someone attacks us,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.48,0:11:23.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the first thing to take a\Nbeating will be our ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.65,0:11:25.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you use your head, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.97,0:11:28.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to mention it's\Neasier to fight from land
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.10,0:11:30.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than from an altar\Nfloating on a cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:33.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER, LUFFY laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:34.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Camping!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.56,0:11:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't a party!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.73,0:11:37.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're in enemy territory!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.44,0:11:38.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:40.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNot a party. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:43.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was shot into\Nthe sky like us.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.29,0:11:49.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NExcellent work!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.29,0:11:51.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, based on your reports,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.12,0:11:53.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we've learned that the priests\Ncan predict our movements
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.00,0:11:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,using a power they\Nlike to call Mantra.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.25,0:11:58.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And the bird blows flames\Nand the spear burns you.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.67,0:12:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But most importantly\Nwe've learned this:
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.21,0:12:03.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold is not a\Nthousand leagues under the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:04.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,as we had thought, but it is
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.91,0:12:07.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hidden somewhere\Non this very island.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.09,0:12:08.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.84,0:12:10.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was the first\Nthing I told you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.09,0:12:13.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what is this Mantra\Nbusiness all about?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.04,0:12:17.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's some kind of sixth\Nsense you only get up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.15,0:12:18.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sixth sense?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.80,0:12:21.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yo, Chopper, do I need to\Ngrind this down any more?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.62,0:12:24.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYes. It needs\Nto be a fine powder.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.16,0:12:27.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's suffered a lot of damage\Nto his digestive system.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.54,0:12:32.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY chuckles]\NThis is it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.84,0:12:35.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An adventure with\Ngold at the end!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.05,0:12:37.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.55,0:12:39.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Glad to see someone\Non my side. I'm ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.01,0:12:41.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.26,0:12:42.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you forget what that\Nscary guerilla guy said
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.01,0:12:45.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about execution?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.23,0:12:47.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,God will be really mad.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN chuckles]\NSounds like fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, we wouldn't be\Nvery good pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.92,0:12:54.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if we turned our backs on gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.71,0:12:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So let's not.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.10,0:12:57.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.40,0:13:00.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know everybody up\Nhere already hates us.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means I'm in.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.10,0:13:03.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.06,0:13:07.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't you even a little\Nfrightened of the wrath of God?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.02,0:13:11.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, I wanna live! Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:19.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.61,0:13:20.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.61,0:13:23.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it's all waitin' for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.67,0:13:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri, you've gotta move!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.87,0:13:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I owe you\None after that Kamakiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:33.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.51,0:13:35.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.93,0:13:37.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.23,0:13:44.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN A]\NWyper! Kamakiri's taken a hit!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.48,0:13:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.23,0:13:47.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIAN A grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:48.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:54.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn. So close to victory.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.41,0:13:58.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh! But you never\Neven had a chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.28,0:14:01.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When night falls, we'll have\Nan even greater advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:03.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:07.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHANDORIANS panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:10.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.85,0:14:12.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're moving out!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.44,0:14:14.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grab all our wounded and meet\Nback at the rendezvous point!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.60,0:14:15.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.82,0:14:20.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM growls]\NYou're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.32,0:14:23.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NOhm, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:24.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.78,0:14:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have been summoned\Nby God Eneru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:38.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[bird chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhy'd you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:45.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY growls]\NAh! Boring!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.75,0:14:48.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NNobody told you\Nto watch the boiling water.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.63,0:14:50.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have one job\Nand one job only.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.63,0:14:53.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take the distilled water\Nand fill up the canteens,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.72,0:14:55.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so make sure that happens.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.39,0:14:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll need fresh\Ndrinking water tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:01.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHmph. Whatever.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.52,0:15:03.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSanji, we found\Ntons of great stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:06.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NExcellent. Let's see the haul.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.10,0:15:08.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We found walnuts,\Naloe, bananas, garlic.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.68,0:15:09.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NRats and frogs, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.98,0:15:11.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice. It all goes in the pot.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.98,0:15:13.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NDisgusting!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.28,0:15:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't expect us\Nto eat that mess, do you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.11,0:15:16.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, silly me.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.74,0:15:19.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, I promise,\NI'l take the garlic out.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.94,0:15:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The garlic's\Nthe only good thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.86,0:15:25.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NIs our navigator\Nhaving another meltdown?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.49,0:15:27.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNow that's what I call a gem.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.84,0:15:29.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:32.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN chuckles]\NBig, yes,\Nbut it's not a gemstone.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.35,0:15:34.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a big salt crystal.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice find, Robin dear.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.06,0:15:38.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found it on the shore.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.81,0:15:40.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I figured we'd\Nfind some use for it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.07,0:15:42.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not only is salt\Nvital to survival,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.09,0:15:45.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but without it, my food\Nwould taste awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[cackles]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.06,0:15:49.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I take half of\Nthe garlic and aloe,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.51,0:15:52.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then I can make antiseptic\Nand burn ointment
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.32,0:15:53.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and use it to heal\Nthe Sky Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:56.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah? You need any frog?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:15:57.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NNo. No frog.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.27,0:15:58.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NZoro, you're not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:02.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got a little job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:03.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.94,0:16:08.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, my swords were not\Nmeant to be used like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.27,0:16:11.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NYeah, but disobey the\Nchef and you probably won't eat.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.24,0:16:12.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it's your call.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.36,0:16:18.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAh! You just\Ndropped a rock in the stew!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.61,0:16:20.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(719,1053)}– Is it good?\N– We don't eat it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.70,0:16:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It helps the pot cook.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.18,0:16:25.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The stone's heat cooks\Nthe stew from the inside out.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.10,0:16:26.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAh...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.18,0:16:27.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this one.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.73,0:16:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll need all the nutrients in\Nthis dish to survive this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.81,0:16:31.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NPerfect, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSmells like we got a winner...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:34.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(682,1053)}– [CHOPPER gasps]\N– [LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.06,0:16:39.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]\NSanji. I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.82,0:16:41.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not ready yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.59,0:16:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Weren't you just\Ncramming a skyshark
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.34,0:16:45.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,down your gullet not\Nten minutes ago?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.85,0:16:48.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. But that\Nwas just an appetizer.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.56,0:16:49.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I figured you knew that.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.83,0:16:52.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He must have\Na rubber stomach, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.49,0:16:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.28,0:16:58.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhat are you doing Usopp?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.45,0:17:00.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji's almost got\Ndinner laid out for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]\NI figured, since\NI wasn't doing anything anyway,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.67,0:17:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd start hauling this wood\Nover to the ship for repairs.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.19,0:17:08.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna\Nswim over there, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.24,0:17:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you don't have a\Nproblem with the giant sharks?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.42,0:17:18.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NThe ship will\Nstill be broken tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:21.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll fix it then.\NLet's eat, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.33,0:17:24.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhat a moron.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.13,0:17:29.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYes! Finished!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.80,0:17:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NSoup's on,\Nbut it's ladies first. Got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.22,0:17:33.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSure.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.50,0:17:34.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NIf you would all\Nplease take your seats,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.76,0:17:36.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be around with\Nyour meals shortly.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.51,0:17:38.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And eat up... I don't\Nwant it getting cold.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.56,0:17:40.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NNow, if you would all\Nlisten up while you eat,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll explain how we're going\Nto handle this tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOohh, it looks tasty!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.19,0:17:49.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway... Let's review\NNoland's book first.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.36,0:17:52.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He discovered the\NCity of Gold 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.32,0:17:54.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, after leaving the\Nisland and returning with
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.36,0:17:57.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,his king, he found the\Ngold ruins had vanished.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.16,0:17:59.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we now know what\Nhappened to these ruins.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.99,0:18:02.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep the ladle handy,\NI'll be back for more after I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:03.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[bong]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.97,0:18:05.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, pay attention!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.01,0:18:08.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI was, but he\Nwas interrupting you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.14,0:18:10.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI compliment his food\Nand this is the thanks I get?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.81,0:18:11.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sheesh!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.91,0:18:14.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI growls]\NThe point I was getting at
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.61,0:18:15.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is that the gold didn't sink
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.95,0:18:18.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,into the ocean, but was\Nshot up here into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:21.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by the knock-up stream\Njust like we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really\Nthink a whole island
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,could have done that?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.67,0:18:26.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWell, it's the only\Nthing that makes sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.01,0:18:28.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember? Cricket\Nsaid that every time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:31.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this phenomenon occurs it's\Nin a different location.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.72,0:18:33.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that explosion\Nwas enormous.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.63,0:18:35.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised\Nit lifted an island.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.76,0:18:38.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHmm. It's just hard\Nto believe that the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.84,0:18:42.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we're sitting in is the same\None we saw back on Jaya.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NI believe that\Nhas something to do with
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.93,0:18:46.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the odd composition of\Nthe island clouds up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.93,0:18:49.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at all the trees,\Nfish, and wildlife.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.27,0:18:51.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something about this\Nenvironment dramatically
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.11,0:18:52.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,increases growth rates.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which explains how\Na society here could have been
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.03,0:18:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,swallowed up by these\Nburgeoning forces.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.77,0:18:58.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NThat also explains\Nwhy the South Birds
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.56,0:19:01.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who saved us were so huge.\NI couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.07,0:19:05.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, 400 years of\Ngrowing will do that to a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThen why... Here.\NWhy did those South Birds
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.07,0:19:10.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,go to such great lengths\Nto save you guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.99,0:19:13.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um... I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.30,0:19:15.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, when they saw him,\Nthey referred to
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.80,0:19:18.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(610.5,1053)}– the Sky Knight as God.\N– [BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.67,0:19:20.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's god? So if we\Nbeat the crud out of this guy,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.04,0:19:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then our job here is done!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NNo, genius!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.70,0:19:25.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How did you get that out\Nof what he's saying?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.12,0:19:27.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWould both of you\Nloudmouths just pipe down?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYeah, shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.77,0:19:30.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah. Wait, who's a loudmouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:33.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(532.5,1053)}– [USOPP] You are!\N– [NAMI] You both are. Can it.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.09,0:19:35.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now does anyone recall\Nwhat Noland's log said
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.31,0:19:36.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about the City of Gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.67,0:19:38.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NI do! It's a city of gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.84,0:19:39.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYou're such a dumbass!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.92,0:19:41.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you ever think\Nbefore you talk?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.91,0:19:43.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think he wrote\Nabout South Birds
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.55,0:19:45.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and a giant gold bell.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.47,0:19:47.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Course there\Ncould be a lot more.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.79,0:19:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The last thing\Nhe wrote in the log before
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he died was something odd.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.53,0:19:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's something\NI can't figure out
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.11,0:19:54.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even after seeing this island.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.30,0:19:57.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It says "The City of Gold\Nis in a skull's right eye."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:20:00.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it! Check it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.25,0:20:03.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I matched up Robin's map of\NJaya with the old Skypiea map
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.55,0:20:05.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that we found in the shipwreck.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.65,0:20:07.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, this isn't\Nexact and there may be
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.49,0:20:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,some incorrect overlap, but\Nwhen you match up the location
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:13.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of Cricket's house with the\Nbroken part we found up here,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.67,0:20:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this is what Jaya looked\Nlike 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.43,0:20:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neat! It's a skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:20.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is a skull!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.16,0:20:23.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.21,0:20:25.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.91,0:20:27.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWe did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.67,0:20:30.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NOkay. But where\Nin the skull's right eye?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHmm...\NI'm thinking right here.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.05,0:20:37.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the one structure\Nthat's actually inside the eye.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.55,0:20:39.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And no one's found it yet\Nbecause of all the people
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.80,0:20:43.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who have tried, we're the\Nones who had both maps.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.10,0:20:47.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NAh. Of course.\NWe must be lucky pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.52,0:20:48.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It kinda makes sense.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.98,0:20:50.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hidden treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:51.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NTreasure! [laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.23,0:20:53.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing left\Nto do is make our way
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.94,0:20:55.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the skull's eye.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.56,0:20:57.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But since we can't\Nleave the ship unguarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:21:00.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,tomorrow morning, we'll split\Nthe crew into two teams.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.61,0:21:02.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is our time.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.03,0:21:05.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On the other side of\Nthis island waits more gold
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than we've ever dreamed.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.44,0:21:11.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY sighs]\NNow that's what I call gourmet!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.24,0:21:12.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we get the gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:14.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou got it! [giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think it'll be sunny again?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.96,0:21:18.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are above the clouds\Nso I'd guess "yes."
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's put out the fires\Nif we don't need them.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.07,0:21:23.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's beginning\Nto get late, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.50,0:21:24.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't want\Nto announce our location
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:26.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to our enemies.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.16,0:21:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHmph. What a rookie move.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.39,0:21:29.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You hear that Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She wants us to douse the fire.\NWhat are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.00,0:21:33.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.99,0:21:35.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.12,0:21:36.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not really\Nher fault though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.93,0:21:39.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's never been exposed\Nto this kind of living before.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.76,0:21:41.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should be tolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.30,0:21:45.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NHuh?\NWhat are you two saying?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.47,0:21:47.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY sobs]\NYou're always\Nsupposed to have a campfire when
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.42,0:21:49.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you camp that's what\Nmakes it camping!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sobs]\N'Cause it's\Nthe warmth of the flame
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.31,0:21:53.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,fighting through\Nall this wilderness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.19,0:21:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that reminds us\Nthat we're human!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.23,0:21:57.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt's never-ending\Nwith those idiots.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.61,0:21:59.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Lay off the sob stories!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.03,0:22:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know how dangerous\Nthis island can be.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.95,0:22:03.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's not give it\Nany help in killing us.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.87,0:22:05.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't care.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.12,0:22:06.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of\Na war between priests
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.87,0:22:09.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,protecting their god and\Nguerillas forging a coup!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.51,0:22:11.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the giant,\Nbloodthirsty monsters
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.54,0:22:13.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that wait around\Nevery corner to eat us
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.96,0:22:15.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NNot monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.34,0:22:17.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sky island scary.\NSky island scary.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.96,0:22:20.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, take a look!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.09,0:22:22.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this enough\Nwood for your fire?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.30,0:22:24.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you idiots\Nthink for one second?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.89,0:22:28.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHeh. Don't worry.\NWild animals are afraid of fire.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.56,0:22:30.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll stay away.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.52,0:22:32.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they're surrounding us.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.19,0:22:34.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to run or we'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:35.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOLF A growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screamin]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:39.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOLF A growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.74,0:22:41.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[barking]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.57,0:22:43.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper. I think\Nit's trying to talk.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.24,0:22:44.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mind translating?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.54,0:22:45.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER whimpers]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.75,0:22:47.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[barking]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:51.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL howling]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.28,0:22:54.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIt's the Festival on\Nthe Night Before, Gold-Hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.99,0:22:57.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY howling]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:22:59.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[howls]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.29,0:23:01.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is fantastic!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.19,0:23:03.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you guys\Nreally make this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.32,0:23:04.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's great! More please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.29,0:23:07.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gulps]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.68,0:23:14.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(587,1053)}– [CHOPPER, SANJI laugh]\N– [ROBIN chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.76,0:23:17.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[howling, laughter]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:18.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH laugh]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.93,0:23:20.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I love you guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.73,0:23:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow the treasure's ours!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.78,0:23:23.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.86,0:23:25.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:27.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[howling, laughter]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.91,0:23:29.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NI'm surprised\Nyou're getting along so well
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.63,0:23:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with the cloud wolves.\N[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.48,0:23:34.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know of no one else\Nwho could have such
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.11,0:23:36.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,raucous festivities\Non Eneru's land.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.95,0:23:39.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NIt's good to\Nsee that you're awake.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.53,0:23:40.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling any better?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.04,0:23:43.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NI apologize for being\Nsuch a burden to you all.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.62,0:23:46.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. You're too hard\Non yourself old man.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.50,0:23:49.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saved Chopper, and you\Nkept our ship from being blown
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.33,0:23:50.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to a thousand pieces.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.67,0:23:51.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThat's my duty.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.88,0:23:53.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NThere's still\Nplenty of stew left.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.21,0:23:54.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you like some?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.21,0:23:55.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThank you, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.38,0:23:56.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.80,0:24:03.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Thanks for everything,\NSky Knight guy! Let's dance!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.06,0:24:05.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NC'mon, dance with us, Gan Fall!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.99,0:24:07.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NChopper, you been drinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.53,0:24:08.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WOLF E howls]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.05,0:24:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, I gotta question.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.97,0:24:12.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Conis. Is she okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.59,0:24:13.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NVery much so.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.80,0:24:15.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've sheltered her and\Nher father at my house.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.01,0:24:17.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.47,0:24:20.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NGreat. I was worried\Nshe'd never see me again.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.43,0:24:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that\Nboth of them are safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.85,0:24:25.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now. Let's celebrate\Nby tossing Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:26.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NWhy me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.74,0:24:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.45,0:24:38.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH whopping, laughin]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.68,0:24:42.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NI'm sorry for eavesdropping,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.18,0:24:44.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I heard your earlier\Nconversation about how
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.13,0:24:47.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this island was known\Nlong ago by the name Jaya.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.73,0:24:49.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NYeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.19,0:24:51.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NBut I believe you\Nhave yet to hear the story
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.19,0:24:53.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of how this island\Non which we sit...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.70,0:24:56.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...came to be known\Nas such holy ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.95,0:25:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LAKI gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.21,0:25:05.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this what was\Nso distracting for you
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.96,0:25:07.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in battle, Laki?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.26,0:25:08.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you here to sabotage us?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.06,0:25:11.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get in our way and slow us down?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.14,0:25:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.\NI feel awful for Kamakiri.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.23,0:25:16.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[WYPER]\NWe were fighting the priests!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.98,0:25:18.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to be\Noff task at all if we want
Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.28,0:25:22.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Apologizing won't\Nfix anything... I know that!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.41,0:25:24.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So give that back to me. Now!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.43,0:25:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It belongs to Aisa! It's hers!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.66,0:25:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promised I would bring\Nback some vearth for her!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.75,0:25:30.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give it back to me! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.16,0:25:32.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(548,1053)}– Shut up!\N– You have to let me have it...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.54,0:25:39.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri. You shouldn't\Neven be standing right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.64,0:25:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI]\NI can still fight.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.41,0:25:46.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI]\NYou're right about\Nthis being our best time
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.20,0:25:47.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to strike the Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.00,0:25:54.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With Satori gone,\Nwe proved today
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.09,0:25:56.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that we can defeat\Nthe remaining priests.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.04,0:25:59.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I say we attack\Nagain tomorrow, at first light.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.09,0:26:09.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThe ground of\Nthe Upper Yard must remind
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.92,0:26:12.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you Blue Sea people\Nof your home far below.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.76,0:26:14.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is similar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.35,0:26:16.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NIt is.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.60,0:26:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NYes. You're lucky.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.06,0:26:21.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What you see all around us\Nand beneath our feet
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.64,0:26:24.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is something that does not\Nnaturally exist in the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.02,0:26:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NIsland cloud\Ncan support plant life,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.36,0:26:29.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it cannot generate its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.61,0:26:33.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Greenery and soil are both\Nforeign things to our life here.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.66,0:26:43.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NOur people have\Nour own name for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.12,0:26:44.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's vearth.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.08,0:26:49.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GAN FALL]\NThose living among\Nthe clouds hold this sacred.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.13,0:26:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's what they all desire.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.26,0:26:56.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI]\NOnce we kill Eneru...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.14,0:26:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...there will be no need\Nfor you to sneak around
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.89,0:27:01.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,obsessing over a\Nsingle bag of vearth.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.10,0:27:03.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The time is now.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.40,0:27:10.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KAMAKIRI]\NWe will return\Nafter 400 years of exile...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.28,0:27:13.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the true home\Nof the Shandorians!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.68,0:27:16.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NAww, come on, Zoro, be a pal!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.45,0:27:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NForget it!\NI'm not going with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.90,0:27:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're scared,\Njust hold it till morning
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.56,0:27:22.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and quit whining, you big baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.61,0:27:25.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpers]\NI would if I could, believe me!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.65,0:27:28.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NJust go take a leak by yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.32,0:27:31.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP groans]\NThat's cold,\NZoro. That's really cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.91,0:27:38.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(635,1053)}– [footsteps crunching]\N– [CHOPPER snores]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.96,0:27:40.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(635,1053)}– [footsteps crunching]\N– [ZORO sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.58,0:27:45.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[footsteps continue]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.97,0:27:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.39,0:27:50.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(720.5,1053)}– [thump]\N– [USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.37,0:27:54.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(494,1053)}– [thump]\N– [USOPP] What was that noise?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.12,0:28:07.21,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be anyone\Non the ship at this hour.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.29,0:28:11.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jeez, this fog is\Nso thick I can't see who it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.12,0:28:14.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.80,0:28:25.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[thumping]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.26,0:28:26.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.64,0:28:39.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.06,0:28:41.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.06,0:28:44.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP whimpering]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.73,0:28:49.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's your problem, you moron?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.44,0:28:51.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you fall asleep mid-piss?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.90,0:28:54.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.70,0:28:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpers]\NI... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.16,0:28:58.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw... I...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.99,0:29:01.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp,\Nwould you snap out of it?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.62,0:29:04.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI saw... a ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.79,0:29:08.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A ghost. A ghost...!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.15,0:29:12.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NWhy are we...?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.51,0:29:20.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(678,1053)}– Hey.\N– [GEDATSU growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.40,0:29:26.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna say\Nsomething, spit it out.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.69,0:29:29.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there\Nchewing on your lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.74,0:29:31.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NAh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.74,0:29:35.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NAh... Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.03,0:29:37.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We all know why we're here,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.74,0:29:39.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because you let Wyper\Nget away instead of
Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.41,0:29:41.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,killing him when\Nyou had the chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.29,0:29:44.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now God Eneru will\Npunish us all for your failure!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.40,0:29:49.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NYou think you're pretty\Nhot stuff since you got lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.74,0:29:52.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and beat that fool Gan Fall,\Ndon't you, Shura?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.15,0:29:54.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU growls]\NAmusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.16,0:29:57.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.95,0:30:01.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YAMA]\NYour Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.30,0:30:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your priests have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.00,0:30:05.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NVery well. Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.25,0:30:07.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gate creeks]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.17,0:30:10.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GROUP growling]
Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.17,0:30:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YAMA]\NNot again.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.72,0:30:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.22,0:30:19.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is disgraceful!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.72,0:30:23.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YAMA]\NYou should be ashamed!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.85,0:30:24.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.06,0:30:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These two have held\Nme back far too long!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.86,0:30:29.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just let me unleash\Nmy full power!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.18,0:30:31.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I could take care of\Nthis whole island myself if it
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.60,0:30:35.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,weren't for these two bunglers\Nalways getting in my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.57,0:30:38.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah! That's some\Nbig talk, Shura.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:38.69,0:30:41.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's time for me to teach\Nyou what the true meaning
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.20,0:30:44.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of power is if ya think\Nyou've got the guts.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:48.87,0:30:53.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can handle,\Nheh, the Ordeal of Iron.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.85,0:30:55.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Ordeal of\NIron couldn't even
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.43,0:30:57.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,test the strength of a child!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:59.23,0:31:02.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NMy Ordeal of Swamp\Nis the ultimate challenge!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.90,0:31:05.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Try that if you're\Nnot too afraid!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.95,0:31:08.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My Lord Gedatsu,\Nthat looks extremely tiring.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.78,0:31:11.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want to cross your arms\Nyou need to hold them like this
Dialogue: 50,0:31:11.24,0:31:12.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and rest them on your chest.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.07,0:31:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.53,0:31:17.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough! Cease this chatter!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.41,0:31:19.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're standing in the\Npresence of God himself!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.08,0:31:23.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? I see an empty chair.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.20,0:31:25.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't see\Nanyone sitting in it!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:26.74,0:31:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Surprise, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.41,0:31:30.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.16,0:31:33.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.70,0:31:34.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.33,0:31:39.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:45.13,0:31:46.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:47.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here I am.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:47.80,0:31:50.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You boys are getting slow.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.85,0:31:52.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're out of practice.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:52.14,0:31:54.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that pathetic display\Nis any indication,
Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.56,0:31:56.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you're all well on your\Nway toward ending up
Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.60,0:31:58.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,dismal failures like Satori.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:58.53,0:32:01.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU growls]\NWhat is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.73,0:32:03.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, God?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:03.12,0:32:04.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do you mock us?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:04.28,0:32:06.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that the reason\Nyou summoned us here?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.29,0:32:08.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To entertain yourself?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:08.12,0:32:09.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NI was bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.52,0:32:11.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.83,0:32:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now have a seat.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:13.68,0:32:15.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to have\Ngiven too much thought
Dialogue: 50,0:32:15.46,0:32:18.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the Blue Sea\Ndwellers yet, have you?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:18.21,0:32:21.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[OHM]\NGod Eneru, if this\Nis about Satori's failure.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:21.38,0:32:23.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU]\NThat idiot\Nwas too inexperienced.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:23.59,0:32:27.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA]\NAnd that ridiculous\NOrdeal of Spheres! Ha!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:27.97,0:32:32.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're hardly in\Na position to talk, Shura.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:33.24,0:32:35.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, they are looking for gold.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.70,0:32:37.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's obvious.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:37.58,0:32:39.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, gold?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.24,0:32:41.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impossible. How?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:41.25,0:32:42.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How did they know?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:43.04,0:32:46.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NThis island was\Noriginally part of the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:46.58,0:32:49.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not so odd that they\Nshould know about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:52.84,0:32:55.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course,\Nthey'll move tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:55.34,0:32:57.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As will the Shandorians.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:58.42,0:33:00.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NThe rules state that\Nyou each run an area of
Dialogue: 50,0:33:00.55,0:33:02.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Upper Yard, and you're\Nnot allowed to enter
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:07.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,each other's areas or interfere\Nwith one another in any way.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:07.23,0:33:10.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I'll allow you\Nto go where you will.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:10.64,0:33:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You may set up your\Nordeals wherever you want.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:14.40,0:33:16.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There will be no restrictions.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:16.48,0:33:18.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get as vicious as you like.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:18.98,0:33:21.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you being\Nso generous all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:21.66,0:33:23.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because, my friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:23.24,0:33:27.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am pleased to announce that\Nthe Maxim is almost complete.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:27.29,0:33:28.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it's time\Nfor us to put an end to
Dialogue: 50,0:33:29.04,0:33:31.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this wretched island and\Nset forth on our journey
Dialogue: 50,0:33:31.71,0:33:33.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to the world of dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.10,0:33:39.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]\NIt's true! I wasn't dreaming!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:39.23,0:33:41.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone was here last night!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:41.12,0:33:42.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[STRAW HAT CREW]\N– The Going Merry!\N– The Going Merry!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:42.88,0:33:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's been repaired!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.92,0:33:47.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI knew it!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:48.28,0:33:50.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See, guys?\NI told you I wasn't insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.95,0:33:53.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpers, sobs]
Dialogue: 50,0:33:53.74,0:33:55.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI don't believe it.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:55.33,0:33:56.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The mast is fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.83,0:33:57.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, now that's service!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.71,0:34:02.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I hate to say it,\Nbut they did a lousy job.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:02.46,0:34:04.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, whoever\Ndid it sure is nice!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:04.47,0:34:06.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But who'd risk crossing a\Nriver full of skysharks to come
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.93,0:34:10.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,all the way out here\Nand fix our ship for us?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:10.31,0:34:13.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, as far as we\Ncan tell, the only people here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.10,0:34:15.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on Upper Yard are\Nus and our enemies.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:15.81,0:34:18.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you notice\Nthey took all the flying gear
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.36,0:34:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,off the ship? That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.28,0:34:24.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHmm... Yeah,\NI been thinking about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.78,0:34:26.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and it's really\Ngot me wondering.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:30.49,0:34:33.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh. It just doesn't\Nmake any sense to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:33.46,0:34:35.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could this phantom repairman\Nknow what the Merry's supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.92,0:34:37.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to look like?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:37.75,0:34:39.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd he know she\Ndidn't always have a comb,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.63,0:34:42.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or wings, or a tail?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:43.08,0:34:47.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHmm... How could\Nhe possibly have known?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:52.30,0:34:56.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Merry,\Njust tell me who I saw.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:00.22,0:35:02.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NOkay, let's look at the map.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:02.33,0:35:06.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The exploration team will be\Ntaking this route moving south.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:06.73,0:35:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There should be\Nsome old ruins near
Dialogue: 50,0:35:08.27,0:35:09.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the skull's right eye.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:09.75,0:35:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye out for enemies\Nand bring back that gold!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:13.05,0:35:14.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHeh. You make it sound so easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:15.00,0:35:17.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're the one\Nwho keeps talking about gold
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.13,0:35:18.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and more gold,\Nbut you're not coming?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:18.96,0:35:21.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, of course not...\Nit's way too scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:21.42,0:35:22.68,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NShe wants the gold,
Dialogue: 50,0:35:22.76,0:35:24.80,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,but she doesn't want\Nto risk anything to get it?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:24.89,0:35:26.62,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's just too weird!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:26.62,0:35:28.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWe'll be in danger,\Ntoo, you know.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:28.92,0:35:32.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll be taking the Merry\Ndown river through the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:32.67,0:35:35.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll head for\Nthe beach near the ruins
Dialogue: 50,0:35:35.45,0:35:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWe can meet up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:37.32,0:35:39.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And then we can escape\Nthis stupid sky island!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:40.57,0:35:43.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At long last, we'll be a rich\Nand powerful pirate crew!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:43.82,0:35:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Able to buy anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.28,0:35:48.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!\NAll the meat I can eat!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:48.62,0:35:49.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NEscape. That sounds great!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:49.95,0:35:51.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NJust don't make me the bait!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:52.59,0:35:55.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NLook! The weather's perfect!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:55.09,0:35:56.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NSure, we're\Non top of the clouds.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:56.87,0:35:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NOkay! We'll all meet\Nsafely on the east coast!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:00.35,0:36:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(517.5,1053)}– [USOPP] You bet!\N– [LUFFY] Let's get going, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.68,0:36:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.01,0:36:13.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GEDATSU growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:36:33.99,0:36:36.87,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SHURA]\NWho will fall\Nbefore my Ordeal of String?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:36.95,0:36:40.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The Shandorians or\Nthe Blue Sea dwellers?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.17,0:36:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ENERU]\NAnd so the festival begins.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:48.92,0:36:52.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.\NToday will be a great day.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
